  m_text: "The Hall splits into a large open room. A large stone starcase fills the
    right side of the room drabbed in cobwebs.\n\nAn Old ornate arched wooden door
    stands to the left. \n\nIn between them  an open window with a feint cold breeze
    blowing in."
